{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"bicep","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Bicep","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Bicep (.bicep .bicepparam).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"bicep","name":"Bicep","extensions":[".bicep",".bicepparam"],"grammar":"grammars/bicep.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Bicep","path":"snippets/bicep.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/bicep.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"'''\",\n      \"end\": \"'''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z]+(?=\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\{[^}]*\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:targetScope|dependsOn|resource|metadata|existing|extends|module|output|import|parent|param|using|false|scope|type|func|true|null|var|for|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:secureString|secureObject|string|object|array|bool|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:resourceGroup|subscription|uniqueString|deployment|contains|toLower|toUpper|replace|concat|format|length|union|empty|json)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/bicep.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Parameter\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"param\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"param ${1:name} ${2:string} = '${3:default}'\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A parameter\"\n  },\n  \"Resource\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"res\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"resource ${1:name} '${2:Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts@2023-01-01}' = {\",\n      \"  name: ${3:'name'}\",\n      \"  location: ${4:resourceGroup().location}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A resource\"\n  },\n  \"Output\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"out\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"output ${1:name} ${2:string} = ${3:value}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An output\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:name} '${2:./module.bicep}' = {\",\n      \"  name: '${1:name}'\",\n      \"  params: {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"  }\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Bicep\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Bicep.\n\n## Files\n\n`.bicep`, `.bicepparam`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `param` | A parameter |\n| `res` | A resource |\n| `out` | An output |\n| `mod` | A module |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}